---
description: Latvian full male name — one given name and one surname (Jānis Bērziņš), given name first. Latvian carries a single surname, never the two-surname Spanish form. The surname is drawn from the masculine list, which is the only correct one for a male row.
generator: tdc
locale: lv
---
<sequence name="p">
